# Asset manifests and contour maps are verified by SHA of their exact bytes.
# Preserve their bytes across Windows, macOS and GitHub checkouts.
*.json -text whitespace=blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.wav binary
*.aiff binary

# Apple build scripts must be executable by bash on a macOS runner.
*.sh text eol=lf
